cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SovereignBench, please cite it as below."
title: "SovereignBench: Geopolitical Forced-Choice Behavior in Language Models"
abstract: >-
  A forced-choice evaluation suite and a four-axis judge for studying how
  language models choose between a United States-associated and a China-
  associated option in symmetric game-theory dilemmas, and how that choice
  shifts under an assigned national identity and under prompt language.
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-16
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/dreadnode/sovereignbench"
authors:
